{"id":"844544f2-2e68-4105-918e-f39761f0bc23","object":"chat.completion","created":1793351710,"model":"deepseek-flash","choices":[{"index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":"I’ll apply the configuration change first, adding a validated cached descriptor without altering the existing descriptor or refresh machinery.\n\n```python\nr = replace_text_batch(\n    'deepinfer/environ.py',\n    [\n        {\n            'old_text': '''def _str(v: str | None, default: str = \"\") -> str:\n    return v if v is not None else default\n\n\n_descriptors: dict[str, EnvVar[Any]] = {}\n''',\n            'new_text': '''def _str(v: str | None, default: str = \"\") -> str:\n    return v if v is not None else default\n\n\ndef _log_max_message_chars(v: str | None) -> int | None:\n    if v is None:\n        return None\n    try:\n        value = int(v)\n    except (TypeError, ValueError) as e:\n        raise ValueError(f\"DEEPINFER_LOG_MAX_MESSAGE_CHARS must be an integer >= 32, got {v!r}\") from e\n    if value < 32:\n        raise ValueError(f\"DEEPINFER_LOG_MAX_MESSAGE_CHARS must be >= 32, got {value}\")\n    return value\n\n\n_descriptors: dict[str, EnvVar[Any]] = {}\n''',\n        },\n        {\n            'old_text': '''    DEEPINFER_RINGBUFFER_WARNING_INTERVAL = EnvVar.int(default=60)\n    DEEPINFER_GC_INTERVAL_STEP = EnvVar.int(default=1000)\n''',\n            'new_text': '''    DEEPINFER_RINGBUFFER_WARNING_INTERVAL = EnvVar.int(default=60)\n    DEEPINFER_GC_INTERVAL_STEP = EnvVar.int(default=1000)\n    DEEPINFER_LOG_MAX_MESSAGE_CHARS = EnvVar(_log_max_message_chars)\n''',\n        },\n    ],\n    'fe2c531989c419f0b51b169a07f5ed826dcec7f95c0c5bc3a351805923c4f218',\n)\nprint(r)\n```","reasoning_content":"We need implement three edits. Need read full mechanisms maybe already have enough evidence: environ full class, rearm; logger formatter and setup; stats _log_worker. Need first write reading satisfied. Apply scoped edits.\n\nConfig: add logging config with validation. Could